      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Briarwood%2C_Queens"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ralph Bunche, the 1950 Nobel Peace Prize‑winning diplomat, called Briarwood home during his career.",
